  "raw": "{\"teaching_intent\":\"让学生在暂停、慢放、拖动与改参中观察：位置沿圆轨道变化时，速度箭头始终沿切线、向心加速度/径向力箭头始终指向圆心并持续转向；比较速率、半径、质量改变后，周期、向心加速度、径向力、动能与机械能读数如何随之变化，但不在页面内推公式，只消费模型采样结果。\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='zh-CN'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>匀速圆周运动：方向持续变化</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;background:#0f172a;color:#e5e7eb}main{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px}h1{font-size:22px;margin:6px 0 2px}.sub{color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 0 12px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:14px}.card{background:#111827;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:16px;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0006}.stage{min-height:330px}svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%,#1e293b,#020617 72%);border-radius:14px}.lab{color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px}.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:9px 0}.ctl{flex:1 1 180px;min-width:170px}.ctl output{float:right;color:#fde68a}input[type=range]{width:100%;min-height:44px}button{min-height:44px;min-width:64px;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:#2563eb;color:white;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}button.ghost{background:#334155}button:active{transform:scale(.98)}.times{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}.pill{background:#0b1220;border:1px solid #475569;border-radius:12px;padding:8px;text-align:center}.pill b{display:block;font-size:18px;color:#fff}.read{white-space:pre-line;background:#020617;border:1px solid #475569;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;min-height:128px;color:#d1fae5}.hint{color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}.v{stroke:#22c55e}.a{stroke:#ef4444}.r{stroke:#60a5fa}.txt{fill:#e5e7eb;font-size:12px}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.times{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}h1{font-size:19px}}</style></head><body><!--HARNESS_PRIMITIVES--><!--HARNESS_MODEL--><!--HARNESS_INPUT--><main><h1>匀速圆周运动：看方向怎样一直变</h1><p class='sub'>拖到任意物理时间，观察切线速度、指向圆心的加速度与径向力；改参后会重新采样并回到 0 秒暂停。</p><section class='grid'><div class='card stage'><svg viewBox='0 0 420 330' aria-label='圆周运动舞台'><defs><marker id='m' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='8' refY='5' markerWidth='6' markerHeight='6' orient='auto-start-reverse'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='currentColor'/></marker></defs><circle cx='210' cy='165' r='118' fill='none' stroke='#334155' stroke-dasharray='4 6'/><circle id='path' cx='210' cy='165' r='100' fill='none' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='2'/><line id='rad' class='r' x1='210' y1='165' x2='210' y2='65' stroke-width='3' marker-end='url(#m)'/><line id='vel' class='v' x1='210' y1='65' x2='260' y2='65' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#m)'/><line id='acc' class='a' x1='210' y1='65' x2='210' y2='115' stroke-width='4' marker-end='url(#m)'/><circle id='stu' cx='210' cy='65' r='8' fill='#fbbf24' stroke='#78350f' stroke-width='2'/><text class='txt' x='14' y='24'>绿：速度方向　红：向心加速度　蓝：半径/径向力方向</text><text id='ang' class='txt' x='14' y='308'>采样角 0.00 rad</text></svg><div class='row'><button id='play'>播放</button><button data-replay class='ghost'>回到 0 并重播</button><button class='ghost' data-rate='0.25'>0.25×</button><button class='ghost' data-rate='1'>1×</button><button class='ghost' data-rate='2'>2×</button></div><input id='scrub' data-control type='range' min='0' max='1000' value='0' aria-label='拖动一个周期内的物理时间'><div class='times'><div class='pill'><span class='lab'>物理时间</span><b data-physical-time>0.00 s</b></div><div class='pill'><span class='lab'>演示倍率</span><b data-demo-time>1.00×</b></div><div class='pill'><span class='lab'>周期(模型)</span><b id='per'>-</b></div><div class='pill'><span class='lab'>向心加速度(模型)</span><b id='ca'>-</b></div></div></div><aside class='card'><h2 style='margin:2px 0 8px;font-size:18px'>可调场景参数</h2><label class='ctl'>速率 v <output id='ov'></output><input id='speed' data-control type='range' min='1' max='12' step='0.1'></label><label class='ctl'>半径 r <output id='or'></output><input id='radius' data-control type='range' min='1.5' max='6' step='0.1'></label><label class='ctl'>质量 m <output id='om'></output><input id='mass' data-control type='range' min='20' max='80' step='1'></label><div class='row'><span class='hint'>只改变 uniform 场景的 v、r、m；mode、G、g 等保持老师确认值。</span></div><h2 style='margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:18px'>状态读数</h2><div class='read' data-readout>等待模型采样…</div><p class='hint'>因果观察点：速率大小不变时，速度方向仍随位置转动；加速度不为零，因为它描述的是方向变化率。</p></aside></section></main><script>(function(){'use strict';var $=function(s){return document.querySelector(s)};var hi=globalThis.__HARNESS_INPUT__;if(!hi||!hi.scenario){$('[data-readout]').textContent='未检测到老师确认场景。';return}var base=hi.scenario,scenario=Object.assign({},base);var N=241,data=null,period=1,playing=false;var phys=$('[data-physical-time]'),demo=$('[data-demo-time]'),read=$('[data-readout]'),stu=$('#stu'),vel=$('#vel'),acc=$('#acc'),rad=$('#rad'),path=$('#path'),ang=$('#ang');var sp=$('#speed'),ra=$('#radius'),ma=$('#mass'),ov=$('#ov'),or=$('#or'),om=$('#om');function labs(){ov.textContent=Number(scenario.speed_m_s).toFixed(1)+' m/s';or.textContent=Number(scenario.radius_m).toFixed(1)+' m';om.textContent=Number(scenario.mass_kg).toFixed(0)+' kg'}function axis(){var a=[];for(var i=0;i<N;i++){a.push(i*Math.PI*2/(N-1))}return a}function sample(){data=coursewareModel.sample({scenario:Object.assign({},scenario),angles_rad:axis()});period=data.events&&data.events.period_s>0?data.events.period_s:1;$('#per').textContent=period.toFixed(3)+' s';$('#ca').textContent=Number(data.events.centripetal_acceleration_m_s2).toFixed(3)+' m/s²'}function scale(){return 100/Math.max(1,scenario.radius_m)}function setLine(l,x1,y1,x2,y2){l.setAttribute('x1',x1);l.setAttribute('y1',y1);l.setAttribute('x2',x2);l.setAttribute('y2',y2)}function fmt(x,d){return Number(x).toFixed(d)}function render(t){if(!data||!data.states||!data.states.length)return;var f=(t%period)/period,i=Math.max(0,Math.min(data.states.length-1,Math.round(f*(data.states.length-1))));var s=data.states[i],k=scale(),cx=210,cy=165,x=cx+s.x_m*k,y=cy-s.y_m*k;path.setAttribute('r',scenario.radius_m*k);stu.setAttribute('cx',x);stu.setAttribute('cy',y);setLine(rad,cx,cy,x,y);var j=i<data.states.length-1?i+1:0,h=i>0?i-1:data.states.length-1,vx=(data.states[j].x_m-data.states[h].x_m)*k,vy=-((data.states[j].y_m-data.states[h].y_m)*k);var vl=Math.hypot(vx,vy);if(vl>1e-9&&s.speed_m_s>1e-9){vx=vx/vl*54;vy=vy/vl*54;setLine(vel,x,y,x+vx,y+vy)}else{setLine(vel,x,y,x,y)}var ax=s.ax_m_s2*k,ay=-s.ay_m_s2*k,al=Math.hypot(ax,ay);if(al>1e-9){ax=ax/al*64;ay=ay/al*64;setLine(acc,x,y,x+ax,y+ay)}else{setLine(acc,x,y,x,y)}ang.textContent='采样角 '+fmt(s.angle_rad,2)+' rad';read.textContent='位置 x='+fmt(s.x_m,2)+' m, y='+fmt(s.y_m,2)+' m\\n速率 |v|='+fmt(s.speed_m_s,2)+' m/s（方向见绿箭头）\\n加速度 ax='+fmt(s.ax_m_s2,2)+', ay='+fmt(s.ay_m_s2,2)+' m/s²\\n径向力='+fmt(s.radial_force_n,1)+' N，绳/支持等效张力='+fmt(s.tension_n,1)+' N\\n动能='+fmt(s.kinetic_j,1)+' J，势能='+fmt(s.potential_j,1)+' J，机械能='+fmt(s.mechanical_j,1)+' J'}sp.value=base.speed_m_s;ra.value=base.radius_m;ma.value=base.mass_kg;scenario=Object.assign({},base);labs();sample();var tl=CoursewarePrimitives.createTimeline({durationPhysicalS:3600,onChange:function(st){playing=!!st.playing;$('#play').textContent=playing?'暂停':'播放';phys.textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatPhysicalTime(st.physicalTimeS);demo.textContent=CoursewarePrimitives.formatDemoRate(st.demoRate);render(st.physicalTimeS)}});function stop0(){tl.pause();tl.seek(0);playing=false;$('#play').textContent='播放';$('#scrub').value=0}function changed(){scenario.speed_m_s=Number(sp.value);scenario.radius_m=Number(ra.value);scenario.mass_kg=Number(ma.value);labs();sample();stop0();render(0)}[sp,ra,ma].forEach(function(el){el.addEventListener('input',changed);el.addEventListener('change',changed)});$('#play').addEventListener('click',function(){if(playing){tl.pause()}else{tl.play()}});$('[data-replay]').addEventListener('click',function(){tl.replay()});Array.prototype.forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-rate]'),function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){tl.setDemoRate(Number(b.getAttribute('data-rate')))})});$('#scrub').addEventListener('input',function(){var f=Number(this.value)/1000;tl.pause();tl.seek(f*period);playing=false;$('#play').textContent='播放'});document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',function(){if(document.hidden){tl.pause();playing=false;$('#play').textContent='播放'}});stop0();render(0)})();</script></body></html>\"}",
